🗄 <b>Postgres</b> (5432/tcp) is never opened to Anywhere. Send the network to allow, for example:
<code>/fw_allow 10.0.0.0/8 5432/tcp</code>

🗄 <b>Redis</b> (6379/tcp) is never opened to Anywhere. Send the network to allow, for example:
<code>/fw_allow 10.0.0.0/8 6379/tcp</code>
